  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">(10 fotos) El viento ha derribado un tercer &aacute;rbol en Tales la madrugada eeste domingo al lunes en el camino de acceso a la urbanizaci&oacute;n Falda del Mont&iacute; y al convento de las monjas. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/P1730126.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">El teniente de alcalde Manuel Serrano Rodr&iacute;guez ha estado all&iacute; desviando el tr&aacute;fico hacia el otro lado del camino hasta que </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/TallenArbreBombers5.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">sobre las 10 horas han llegado dos bomberos voluntarios del parque comarcal Espad&aacute;n Mijares para cortarlo y retirarlo.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/arbrecaiguttales111217.jpg\" alt=\"arbrecaiguttales111217\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/p1730124.jpg\" alt=\"p1730124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/p1730125.jpg\" alt=\"p1730125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/p1730126.jpg\" alt=\"p1730126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/tallenarbrebombers1.jpg\" alt=\"tallenarbrebombers1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/tallenarbrebombers2.jpg\" alt=\"tallenarbrebombers2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/tallenarbrebombers3.jpg\" alt=\"tallenarbrebombers3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/tallenarbrebombers4.jpg\" alt=\"tallenarbrebombers4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/tallenarbrebombers5.jpg\" alt=\"tallenarbrebombers5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arbrecaiguttales111217/tallenarbrebombers6.jpg\" alt=\"tallenarbrebombers6\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
